{"id": "8e33ac97-cc6a-4d4b-ac9e-be641a29e092", "slug": "quality-assurance-feature-list-5", "title": "Quality Assurance Feature List", "description": "Quality Assurance Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Quality Assurance Feature List\"\ndescription: \"Quality Assurance Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#A2D2F5\"\n  secondary: \"#CBD5E1\"\n  accent: \"#94A3B8\"\n  background: \"#CBD5E1\"\n  surface: \"#94A3B8\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#CBD5E1\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"1px\"\n  control: \"1px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Quality Assurance Feature List\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 221; favorites: 9; remixes: 2.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta.\n## Overview\nQuality Assurance Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nRigorous standards, exceptional outcomes Your treatments arrive seamlessly from our certified pharmacy network, delivered directly to you with uncompromising reliability. Each formulation undergoes comprehensive evaluat…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Rigorous standards, exceptional outcomes; Concentration; Purity; Balance; Toxin-Free.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #A2D2F5, secondary #CBD5E1, accent #94A3B8, background #CBD5E1, surface #94A3B8, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Quality Assurance Feature List</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"scroll-smooth antialiased selection:bg-white/20 selection:text-white relative overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Atmospheric Sky Background -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[-1] overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #082142 0%, #1e528b 45%, #6e9fc5 100%);\">\n        <!-- Soft Cloud Light Masses -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[-15%] left-[-10%] w-[70vw] h-[70vw] rounded-full mix-blend-overlay\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%); filter: blur(60px);\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-15%] right-[-15%] w-[80vw] h-[80vw] rounded-full mix-blend-overlay\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(162,210,245,0.25) 0%, rgba(162,210,245,0) 70%); filter: blur(90px);\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[25%] right-[10%] w-[45vw] h-[45vw] rounded-full mix-blend-overlay\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%); filter: blur(50px);\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Thin Framing Rails -->\n    <main class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto relative border-l border-r border-white/10 min-h-screen px-6 py-20 lg:py-32\">\n\n        <!-- Subtle Corner Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/30 rounded-[1px]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/30 rounded-[1px]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/30 rounded-[1px]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white/30 rounded-[1px]\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header Section -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-24 lg:mb-40 relative z-10\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-[64px] font-light tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white\">\n                Rigorous standards,<br>\n                <span class=\"italic text-white/90\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">exceptional outcomes</span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- 3D Animation Container -->\n            <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"relative w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[450px] pointer-events-none lg:pointer-events-auto flex justify-center lg:justify-end\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Content Section -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 relative z-10\">\n\n            <!-- Left Column: Description -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 lg:pr-8 flex flex-col gap-8\">\n                <p class=\"text-[22px] font-light leading-[1.35] text-white/95\">\n                    Your treatments arrive seamlessly from our certified pharmacy network, delivered directly to you with uncompromising reliability.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/70 leading-[1.6]\">\n                    Each formulation undergoes comprehensive evaluation in advanced microbiology and chemistry laboratories to exceed rigorous safety protocols. This steadfast commitment guarantees absolute confidence and optimal efficacy for our users, adhering to the highest cGMP manufacturing standards.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: Feature List -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6\">\n\n                <!-- Feature 01 -->\n                <div class=\"py-10 border-t border-white/20 group relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/40\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-start gap-4 md:gap-8 relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex gap-4 md:gap-6\">\n                            <div class=\"text-white/30 font-light text-sm mt-1.5 font-mono tracking-widest\">01</div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-[32px] font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">Concentration</h3>\n                                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" width=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest leading-none pt-[1px]\">Verified</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/70 leading-[1.6] md:text-right md:max-w-[400px] pt-2 group-hover:text-white/90 transition-colors duration-500\">\n                            Verified quarterly. Ensures the formula maintains the exact active ingredient levels within a strict 10% tolerance margin.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Feature 02 -->\n                <div class=\"py-10 border-t border-white/20 group relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/40\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-start gap-4 md:gap-8 relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex gap-4 md:gap-6\">\n                            <div class=\"text-white/30 font-light text-sm mt-1.5 font-mono tracking-widest\">02</div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-[32px] font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">Purity</h3>\n                                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" width=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest leading-none pt-[1px]\">Verified</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/70 leading-[1.6] md:text-right md:max-w-[400px] pt-2 group-hover:text-white/90 transition-colors duration-500\">\n                            Guarantees the solution is entirely free from pathogens and microbial contaminants. Every vial adheres to stringent USP 797.1 protocols.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Feature 03 -->\n                <div class=\"py-10 border-t border-white/20 group relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/40\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-start gap-4 md:gap-8 relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex gap-4 md:gap-6\">\n                            <div class=\"text-white/30 font-light text-sm mt-1.5 font-mono tracking-widest\">03</div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-[32px] font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">Balance</h3>\n                                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" width=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest leading-none pt-[1px]\">Verified</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/70 leading-[1.6] md:text-right md:max-w-[400px] pt-2 group-hover:text-white/90 transition-colors duration-500\">\n                            Measures the acid-alkaline harmony to guarantee optimal comfort and minimize irritation during administration.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Feature 04 -->\n                <div class=\"py-10 border-t border-b border-white/20 group relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/40\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-start gap-4 md:gap-8 relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex gap-4 md:gap-6\">\n                            <div class=\"text-white/30 font-light text-sm mt-1.5 font-mono tracking-widest\">04</div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-[32px] font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-3\">Toxin-Free</h3>\n                                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" width=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest leading-none pt-[1px]\">Verified</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/70 leading-[1.6] md:text-right md:max-w-[400px] pt-2 group-hover:text-white/90 transition-colors duration-500\">\n                            Working alongside purity checks, this confirms the absence of harmful bacterial byproducts, keeping well below USP 85 safety thresholds.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Three.js Implementation (Intact Layout/Imagery) -->\n    <script type=\"module\">\n        import * as THREE from 'https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js';\n\n        const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(30, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 100);\n        camera.position.set(0, 0, 15);\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n        const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 1.5);\n        scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n        const dirLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 2);\n        dirLight.position.set(5, 5, 5);\n        scene.add(dirLight);\n\n        function createLabTexture(type) {\n            const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');\n            canvas.width = 600;\n            canvas.height = 800;\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n            ctx.fillStyle = type === 1 ? '#e2e8f0' : type === 2 ? '#f1f5f9' : '#e0e7ff';\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, 600, 800);\n\n            ctx.fillStyle = type === 1 ? '#cbd5e1' : type === 2 ? '#cbd5e1' : '#94a3b8';\n            if (type === 1) {\n                ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(300, 250, 90, 0, Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();\n                ctx.fillRect(200, 360, 200, 440);\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#94a3b8';\n                ctx.fillRect(100, 500, 150, 300);\n            } else if (type === 2) {\n                for(let i=0; i<4; i++) {\n                    ctx.fillRect(120 + i*100, 300, 60, 400);\n                    ctx.fillStyle = '#94a3b8';\n                    ctx.fillRect(130 + i*100, 270, 40, 30);\n                    ctx.fillStyle = '#cbd5e1';\n                }\n            } else {\n                ctx.fillRect(50, 150, 500, 500);\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#cbd5e1';\n                ctx.fillRect(100, 200, 400, 300);\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#f8fafc';\n                ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(300, 350, 60, 0, Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();\n            }\n\n            const texture = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);\n            texture.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\n            return texture;\n        }\n\n        const mixers = [];\n        const group = new THREE.Group();\n        scene.add(group);\n\n        const photoWidth = 2.4;\n        const photoHeight = 3.2;\n\n        const layoutConfig = [\n            { pos: [-2.2, 0.2, 0], rot: [0, 0, 0.15], type: 1, delay: 0 },\n            { pos: [0, 0, 0.5], rot: [0, 0, 0], type: 2, delay: 1 },\n            { pos: [2.2, -0.2, 0.2], rot: [0, 0, -0.15], type: 3, delay: 2 }\n        ];\n\n        layoutConfig.forEach((config) => {\n            const polaroidGroup = new THREE.Group();\n            polaroidGroup.position.set(...config.pos);\n            polaroidGroup.rotation.set(...config.rot);\n\n            const borderGeom = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(photoWidth + 0.2, photoHeight + 0.2);\n            const borderMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                color: 0xffffff,\n                roughness: 0.8,\n                side: THREE.DoubleSide\n            });\n            const borderMesh = new THREE.Mesh(borderGeom, borderMat);\n\n            const shadowGeom = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(photoWidth + 0.2, photoHeight + 0.2);\n            const shadowMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x000000,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.15\n            });\n            const shadowMesh = new THREE.Mesh(shadowGeom, shadowMat);\n            shadowMesh.position.set(0.1, -0.1, -0.05);\n            polaroidGroup.add(shadowMesh);\n\n            polaroidGroup.add(borderMesh);\n\n            const tex = createLabTexture(config.type);\n            const photoGeom = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(photoWidth, photoHeight);\n            const photoMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                map: tex,\n                roughness: 0.4,\n                metalness: 0.1\n            });\n            const photoMesh = new THREE.Mesh(photoGeom, photoMat);\n            photoMesh.position.z = 0.01;\n            polaroidGroup.add(photoMesh);\n\n            group.add(polaroidGroup);\n\n            const mixer = new THREE.AnimationMixer(polaroidGroup);\n            mixers.push(mixer);\n\n            const times = [0, 2, 4];\n            const yBase = polaroidGroup.position.y;\n            const values = [yBase, yBase + 0.15, yBase];\n\n            const floatTrack = new THREE.NumberKeyframeTrack('.position[y]', times, values);\n            const clip = new THREE.AnimationClip(`float_${config.type}`, 4, [floatTrack]);\n\n            const action = mixer.clipAction(clip);\n            action.time = config.delay;\n            action.play();\n        });\n\n        function updateLayout() {\n            camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n\n            if (window.innerWidth >= 1024) {\n                camera.position.x = 0;\n                camera.position.z = 12;\n            } else {\n                camera.position.x = 0;\n                camera.position.z = 15;\n            }\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', updateLayout);\n        updateLayout();\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            const delta = clock.getDelta();\n\n            mixers.forEach(mixer => mixer.update(delta));\n\n            group.rotation.y = Math.sin(clock.getElapsedTime() * 0.2) * 0.05;\n            group.rotation.x = Math.cos(clock.getElapsedTime() * 0.15) * 0.02;\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n\n        animate();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "quality-assurance-feature-list-5.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/quality-assurance-feature-list-5.jpg", "source_name": "quality-assurance-feature-list-5-DESIGN.md", "views": 292, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T07:25:37.359636+00:00"}